 An adaptation rarely seen in Spectra.</strong><br>This brilliant creature, dubbed Poppy resides in the emerald Sanctum of the great highlands...<br><br>A <strong>Poppy sanctuary</strong> was established by the second king of Spectra.<br><br>For some, this is a beautiful home... However dark mysteries reside.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/7f5b4823e46dda0f819cc22b47fb55ca.poster.avif?t=1722971545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/7f5b4823e46dda0f819cc22b47fb55ca.webm?t=1722971545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/7f5b4823e46dda0f819cc22b47fb55ca.mp4?t=1722971545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/d7f1c9b917955d73096041428e974e24.avif?t=1722971545\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/f9633a20d8276759590e7a7cadd921ef.poster.avif?t=1722971545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/f9633a20d8276759590e7a7cadd921ef.webm?t=1722971545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/f9633a20d8276759590e7a7cadd921ef.mp4?t=1722971545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1840250/extras/b3ef454425f8f552fc6fb52ea834613b.poster.avif?t=1722971545\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.ak